1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:30,000
= kisskh.li =

2
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,630
I discussed the project you proposed last time

3
00:00:01,630 --> 00:00:02,960
with my dad.

4
00:00:03,040 --> 00:00:04,960
He said unless someone from Tin Ping became part of our family,

5
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,710
he wouldn't use the group's funds

6
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:07,870
to invest in Tin Ping.

7
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,160
I have a way

8
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:11,910
to get our two groups to work together.

9
00:00:12,110 --> 00:00:13,240
You're getting married?

10
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:14,830
Yes. What's the problem?

11
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:15,910
When you proposed,

12
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,190
did you stop for even a second

13
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,710
and think about how I'd feel

14
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:22,280
if I found out?

15
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:23,670
I went through all this trouble

16
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:25,440
to bring this investment into the company.

17
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,960
Shouldn't you be happy for me?

18
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,160
It's always about your company.

19
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:32,110
Have you ever thought about us?

20
00:00:32,110 --> 00:00:33,560
When I socialise with people,

21
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,920
I have to bring a female companion.

22
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:37,070
A man can only be kept at home.

23
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:38,750
Look at this ashtray.

24
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,200
Look at it.

25
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:41,750
It's beautiful, isn't it?

26
00:00:42,070 --> 00:00:43,710
But would you take it out with you?

27
00:00:46,320 --> 00:00:47,750
Don't be upset over someone who hurt you.

28
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:49,520
Out with the old, in with the new.

29
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:50,430
Come on.

30
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:51,880
I'll drink with you tonight.

31
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:52,520
We won't leave until we're drunk.

32
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,030
Drink until you completely forget him.

33
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:30,940
♪With you, it's like I can breathe again♪

34
00:01:31,370 --> 00:01:34,140
♪I can't live without this breath, this heartbeat♪

35
00:01:34,260 --> 00:01:37,050
♪Forever's too far, but you're right here♪

36
00:01:37,320 --> 00:01:39,480
♪Together we'll take on this jaded world♪

37
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:42,460
♪With you, I'll cross the dark, outrun the pain, and run away♪

38
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:46,620
♪Still believing in true love, no matter how naive, calling you♪

39
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:51,410
♪I'm willing to wait♪

40
00:01:52,260 --> 00:01:55,100
♪I love you like you're a part of me♪

41
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:57,900
♪I want to share my life with you♪

42
00:01:58,540 --> 00:02:04,320
♪To love this deeply, I'll give a little more♪

43
00:02:04,670 --> 00:02:06,470
♪In this cold and gray city♪

44
00:02:06,550 --> 00:02:08,180
♪Through all the pain, I'll hold you. Is it true?♪

45
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:10,630
♪Pieces of our memories slowly fade♪

46
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:11,290
♪Stay with me♪

47
00:02:11,430 --> 00:02:14,040
♪Do you remember the day we crossed paths?♪

48
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:14,820
♪Stay with me♪

49
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:17,740
♪Do you remember the forever we promised?♪

50
00:02:18,230 --> 00:02:20,240
♪Who's waiting for you to save them?♪

51
00:02:20,770 --> 00:02:23,280
♪My heart aches, breaks, and struggles on♪

52
00:02:23,810 --> 00:02:26,320
♪How can I hold on to everything in one moment?♪

53
00:02:27,040 --> 00:02:30,540
♪Stop blaming fate and learn to let it be♪

54
00:02:32,380 --> 00:02:34,140
[Ash]
[Episode 6]

55
00:02:54,260 --> 00:03:06,470
[POLICE]

56
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,150
Officer Chan, come take a look.

57
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,400
One more thing, Officer Chan.

58
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:19,000
We found a nine-millimetre shell casing.

59
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,310
Looks like it came from one of ours.

60
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:34,520
It looks like Officer Mok's.

61
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:51,120
Fei Foon.

62
00:03:55,750 --> 00:03:57,800
Fei Foon, it's me.

63
00:03:59,190 --> 00:04:01,120
I know I was harsh last time.

64
00:04:01,430 --> 00:04:03,560
Let me in, and we'll talk.

65
00:04:10,310 --> 00:04:11,120
Fei Foon?

66
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,150
Fei Foon?

67
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,720
Fei Foon!

68
00:04:27,950 --> 00:04:29,310
Fei Foon?

69
00:04:36,950 --> 00:04:37,720
Fei Foon?

70
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:44,360
Officer Mok!

71
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,360
Hui Loek To!

72
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,270
Where's Officer Mok?

73
00:04:47,270 --> 00:04:48,070
Hui Loek To!

74
00:04:48,510 --> 00:04:49,560
I'm warning you for the last time.

75
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,750
Please leave immediately.

76
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,240
Where's Officer Mok?

77
00:04:53,070 --> 00:04:54,240
What do you want with him?

78
00:04:54,390 --> 00:04:55,510
I have information for him.

79
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:56,870
You can tell me whatever it is.

80
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,870
He's not here. I'll pass it on.

81
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,750
I'll only speak to Officer Mok.

82
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,160
Or get Lam out here.

83
00:05:03,270 --> 00:05:04,040
Are you here to cause trouble?

84
00:05:04,310 --> 00:05:05,510
He's dead, and you're still looking for him?

85
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:07,240
What did you say?

86
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,870
You said Lam is dead?

87
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:11,680
Then where's Mok Fei Foon?

88
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:13,040
Where's Officer Mok?

89
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:14,950
What's going on?

90
00:05:17,750 --> 00:05:20,920
He says he's here for Mok Fei Foon and Joseph.

91
00:05:21,630 --> 00:05:23,720
I just want to know where Mok Fei Foon is.

92
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,560
Can't you even answer a simple question like that?

93
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:29,070
We don't disclose officers' information to just anyone.

94
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:30,920
I've been to his flat.

95
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,070
The place had been completely ransacked.

96
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:34,160
Don't you care what happens to your own colleague?

97
00:05:34,630 --> 00:05:35,720
You can rest assured.

98
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:38,870
We always take our officers' safety very seriously.

99
00:05:41,430 --> 00:05:42,870
So it was you who went to his flat.

100
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,160
Mr. Hui,

101
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,310
get this straight.

102
00:05:45,510 --> 00:05:46,560
We're the police here.

103
00:05:47,120 --> 00:05:49,070
And you're coming into a police station to interrogate us?

104
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,360
But

105
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:52,160
if you do find him,

106
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,510
tell him to turn himself in.

107
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:55,630
If we find him first,

108
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,870
don't blame us for doing things by the book.

109
00:05:59,630 --> 00:06:01,720
You think Officer Mok killed that brat?

110
00:06:01,870 --> 00:06:03,040
He had a name.

111
00:06:03,310 --> 00:06:04,480
His name was Lam Tung Sit.

112
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,040
Mr. Hui,

113
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:08,270
do you have no idea what respect means?

114
00:06:08,950 --> 00:06:10,870
Why do you think Officer Mok killed someone?

115
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:14,630
That's an internal police matter.

116
00:06:14,630 --> 00:06:15,750
We don't owe you an explanation.

117
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:16,720
On,

118
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,270
show him out.

119
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,510
Don't let outsiders wander in again.

120
00:06:20,830 --> 00:06:21,560
No need.

121
00:06:23,750 --> 00:06:25,120
UI12875.

122
00:06:25,390 --> 00:06:26,310
I'll remember you.

123
00:06:58,290 --> 00:07:01,360
[For Rent / Sale]

124
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:18,750
Hey, what are you doing here?

125
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:19,510
Fei Gai!

126
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,240
Who are you?

127
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:32,480
Just here to lie low for a bit, brother.

128
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,680
I'll be gone right away.

129
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:35,680
You think you can just come and go as you please?

130
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:37,630
Do you know Eastern Hall runs this place?

131
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,040
Eastern Hall?

132
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:43,000
The long-established society,

133
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,040
Eastern Hall.

134
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:47,750
Their main business is arms dealing in Southeast Asia.

135
00:07:48,310 --> 00:07:50,680
In a previous deal, the other side

136
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:52,040
[Ho Tung Fong]
caught them paying in counterfeit notes.

137
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:57,070
I've got important police intelligence on organised crime for your boss.

138
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,070
Take me to him.

139
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,950
Uncle Wah's and Sai Tung's people

140
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,560
who know better have mostly switched sides.

141
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:13,560
The rest have either been subdued by us

142
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:15,120
or gone into hiding.

143
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:17,240
Uncle Tai Tang's people are the biggest problem.

144
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,240
They'd rather die than surrender.

145
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,360
Can you handle it?

146
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,190
No problem.

147
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:24,360
I just need a little time.

148
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:27,240
What about the business?

149
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:31,480
When can our people take over?

150
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:35,670
We still haven't found the keys or the account books.

151
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:38,270
It's like Uncle Wah knew we were coming for him.

152
00:08:38,910 --> 00:08:41,150
He handed everything over to someone else.

153
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,320
I'm doing everything I can to find him.

154
00:08:44,910 --> 00:08:46,320
So you're saying we've made no progress at all?

155
00:08:47,030 --> 00:08:48,240
I'm sorry, Ms. Ho.

156
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,150
Instead of apologising,

157
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,360
figure out how we're going to fix this.

158
00:08:54,030 --> 00:08:55,240
The longer this drags on,

159
00:08:56,030 --> 00:08:58,910
the easier it'll be for other gangs to take Eastern Hall's turf.

160
00:09:00,870 --> 00:09:02,720
The other uncles should all be coming to the meeting.

161
00:09:02,960 --> 00:09:05,240
Let's hear what they have to say before we decide.

162
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,360
Understood, Ms. Ho.

163
00:09:12,360 --> 00:09:13,440
You can get back to work now.

164
00:09:14,030 --> 00:09:15,360
One more thing, Ms. Ho.

165
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:17,080
Fan Shu found someone outside.

166
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:20,320
He says he has some organised crime intelligence for you.

167
00:09:21,630 --> 00:09:22,750
Who is he?

168
00:09:22,750 --> 00:09:23,750
No idea.

169
00:09:23,870 --> 00:09:24,750
I've never seen him before.

170
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:26,870
Send him in.

171
00:09:33,270 --> 00:09:34,910
Ms. Ho. Mr. Lok.

172
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:37,440
Hello, Ms. Ho.

173
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,200
Finally, we meet.

174
00:09:42,270 --> 00:09:43,240
What is it? Talk.

175
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:46,240
I'll only tell you in private.

176
00:09:50,240 --> 00:09:51,550
You can leave us.

177
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:53,030
Yes, Ms. Ho.

178
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:57,630
Lok.

179
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:01,480
Yes, Ms. Ho.

180
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,030
Go on.

181
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:08,960
What information do you have?

182
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:15,080
I can tell you how the police think,

183
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,670
how they investigate cases,

184
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,550
and when they'll make their move.

185
00:10:19,870 --> 00:10:21,840
I can help you avoid every danger.

186
00:10:22,270 --> 00:10:24,630
Not only can I help you secure your position,

187
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:28,240
but I can also help you make Eastern Hall even bigger.

188
00:10:29,870 --> 00:10:32,240
How do you know how the police operate?

189
00:10:34,630 --> 00:10:36,670
Because just a few days ago, I was still a police officer.

190
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:41,480
Now I'm a wanted man for killing one.

191
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:44,750
If you don't believe me, turn on the TV.

192
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:47,750
You'll probably see my face in the headlines.

193
00:10:49,150 --> 00:10:50,270
Why should I trust you?

194
00:10:50,670 --> 00:10:52,360
Because if I don't want to stay on the run,

195
00:10:52,360 --> 00:10:54,080
I need someone to protect me.

196
00:10:58,120 --> 00:11:00,320
And you need my help too.

197
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,270
The whole world knows

198
00:11:03,270 --> 00:11:05,480
you killed your father and second uncle to take power.

199
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:08,870
You need results to shut the other uncles up.

200
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:11,670
And I

201
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,630
am the one who can help you do that.

202
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:40,150
Search warrant.

203
00:11:42,910 --> 00:11:43,600
Open up!

204
00:12:07,790 --> 00:12:11,670
[Three days earlier]

205
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,000
Hey, over here.

206
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,440
You came alone?

207
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:44,030
Of course.

208
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:46,630
What's this?

209
00:12:47,270 --> 00:12:48,200
You told me to come up here,

210
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:49,270
but you're standing all the way over there.

211
00:12:49,550 --> 00:12:50,630
Are you messing with me?

212
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:55,440
I know right now it looks

213
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,320
like I killed Joseph.

214
00:12:57,270 --> 00:12:59,000
I don't know whether you believe me,

215
00:12:59,080 --> 00:13:01,440
so we'd better keep some distance.

216
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,840
If anything happens, I can leave straight away.

217
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,790
Honestly,

218
00:13:06,630 --> 00:13:08,480
I don't know exactly what happened,

219
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:10,790
but I do believe you.

220
00:13:13,270 --> 00:13:14,240
No, this won't do.

221
00:13:14,630 --> 00:13:15,840
My throat hurts talking like this.

222
00:13:16,750 --> 00:13:17,790
Come over here, and we'll talk.

223
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,240
If I'd wanted to arrest you,

224
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:25,000
I'd have brought the whole team.

225
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,870
Would I have come up to the rooftop alone?

226
00:13:27,390 --> 00:13:28,150
Come over.

227
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,550
You're really not coming?

228
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:35,240
No?

229
00:13:37,360 --> 00:13:38,790
Fine, I'll come to you.

230
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,000
Don't go anywhere.

231
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,840
Don't leave while I'm coming over.

232
00:13:45,550 --> 00:13:47,000
Please, I'm asking you.

233
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:59,670
So Joseph was Leung Yee's younger brother,

234
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:02,150
and he got close to you for revenge.

235
00:14:02,910 --> 00:14:03,720
That's right.

236
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,480
No wonder.

237
00:14:07,910 --> 00:14:09,480
Last month, Internal Investigations

238
00:14:09,750 --> 00:14:11,720
found that Joseph had ties to Leung Yee

239
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,080
and had an informant investigate him quietly.

240
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,910
We were nearly ready to move,

241
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:17,720
but then this happened.

242
00:14:21,510 --> 00:14:22,630
Give our guys some time

243
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,120
to get to the bottom of it

244
00:14:24,150 --> 00:14:25,360
and clear your name.

245
00:14:25,550 --> 00:14:27,240
Don't go running around at a time like this.

246
00:14:27,240 --> 00:14:28,240
Come back with me first.

247
00:14:28,960 --> 00:14:29,790
Sorry, sir.

248
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,240
I can't go back with you.

249
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:34,120
Now that everyone thinks I'm a traitor

250
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,600
who killed a fellow officer,

251
00:14:35,790 --> 00:14:37,910
I want to use this chance to infiltrate Eastern Hall

252
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:39,790
and keep following the counterfeit money trail.

253
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:43,510
With the heat on like this, you're still thinking about...?

254
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:46,000
Never mind how dangerous infiltrating them would be.

255
00:14:46,630 --> 00:14:48,600
Eastern Hall is tearing itself apart with infighting.

256
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:51,550
You really think you can find any leads in there?

257
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:53,270
I do.

258
00:14:56,390 --> 00:14:58,390
But I'll need your help, Officer Chan.

259
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:09,200
[One year later]

260
00:16:15,150 --> 00:16:16,910
Lok, anything to report?

261
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:20,720
The police raided our Fo Tan base.

262
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,080
It was just as Fei Foon predicted.

263
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:24,550
So we suffered no losses.

264
00:16:25,550 --> 00:16:28,480
Uncle Tai Tang's people have all been dealt with.

265
00:16:29,030 --> 00:16:32,270
We've left their last piece of turf for Foon to handle.

266
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:35,750
No one will interfere with Eastern Hall's business anymore.

267
00:16:36,480 --> 00:16:37,270
Good.

268
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:39,670
Then we'll make an announcement.

269
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:41,480
And we'll summon the heads of every branch...

270
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:42,720
I have something to say.

271
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:48,120
We want you to dump that cop.

272
00:16:49,670 --> 00:16:51,320
I've said this many times.

273
00:16:51,840 --> 00:16:53,240
Foon is my boyfriend.

274
00:16:53,630 --> 00:16:55,240
I trust him completely.

275
00:16:55,630 --> 00:16:56,440
But

276
00:16:56,960 --> 00:17:00,120
keeping a police officer by your side is too risky.

277
00:17:00,630 --> 00:17:02,000
He killed a police officer.

278
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,320
He's a wanted man.

279
00:17:03,720 --> 00:17:04,880
The whole city knows it.

280
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:08,550
Not once has his intel been wrong this past year,

281
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,920
and he's never betrayed us.

282
00:17:10,480 --> 00:17:12,680
I see no problem with keeping him in Eastern Hall.

283
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,920
I'm sorry, Ms. Ho.

284
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:17,510
We just can't trust him.

285
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:20,640
He's getting involved in more of our internal affairs

286
00:17:20,750 --> 00:17:23,070
and learning more and more about Eastern Hall.

287
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:24,830
If things go wrong one day,

288
00:17:25,070 --> 00:17:27,830
who do you think will be the first to inform the police?

289
00:17:31,310 --> 00:17:32,030
Ms. Ho,

290
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:34,510
the uncles' concerns aren't unfounded.

291
00:17:35,550 --> 00:17:36,550
This man

292
00:17:36,750 --> 00:17:37,640
used to be a police officer.

293
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:38,510
That's a fact.

294
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:40,070
For the sake of our society

295
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:42,070
and everyone's safety,

296
00:17:43,550 --> 00:17:45,480
I think we need to be careful with him.

297
00:17:46,880 --> 00:17:48,680
I know what you're worried about.

298
00:17:49,350 --> 00:17:50,350
I'll take care of it.

299
00:18:15,550 --> 00:18:16,350
Ms. Ho.

300
00:18:17,550 --> 00:18:18,160
Sit.

301
00:18:26,510 --> 00:18:28,350
I've dealt with Wah's man.

302
00:18:28,790 --> 00:18:30,750
And I've asked Mr. Lok to help.

303
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:33,830
He'll look after all the venues we've taken back.

304
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:38,590
Just leave that to Lok.

305
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:39,830
You don't need to worry about it.

306
00:18:41,550 --> 00:18:43,400
The uncles are telling me to dump you again.

307
00:18:44,030 --> 00:18:45,640
Calling you my boyfriend

308
00:18:45,640 --> 00:18:47,110
isn't enough to shut them up anymore.

309
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:48,960
Again?

310
00:18:49,830 --> 00:18:52,510
What do I have to do to satisfy them?

311
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,720
We get married.

312
00:18:58,550 --> 00:18:59,350
Get married?

313
00:19:01,110 --> 00:19:04,030
They're afraid that if Eastern Hall gets into trouble and we end up in court,

314
00:19:05,550 --> 00:19:06,550
you'll testify against us.

315
00:19:09,110 --> 00:19:10,000
Fair point.

316
00:19:10,750 --> 00:19:12,350
I know all of Eastern Hall's secrets,

317
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:15,510
so they're afraid I'll put all the blame on them.

318
00:19:16,750 --> 00:19:17,830
Once we're married,

319
00:19:18,350 --> 00:19:20,000
if anything happens and we get arrested,

320
00:19:20,000 --> 00:19:21,510
we can't testify against each other.

321
00:19:22,110 --> 00:19:23,510
Then they won't be afraid you'll inform on us.

322
00:19:24,720 --> 00:19:28,030
And when I put you in charge of more of Eastern Hall's core affairs,

323
00:19:29,030 --> 00:19:30,400
they'll have no reason to object.

324
00:19:32,550 --> 00:19:34,000
Sounds perfect.

325
00:19:35,750 --> 00:19:37,240
I look forward to our partnership,

326
00:19:37,550 --> 00:19:38,200
my fiancée.

327
00:19:54,550 --> 00:19:56,350
Thanks to the intel you gave me, Officer Chan,

328
00:19:56,550 --> 00:19:58,510
Ho Tung Fong trusts me more and more now,

329
00:19:58,510 --> 00:20:00,920
and I've been able to access Eastern Hall's secrets

330
00:20:01,350 --> 00:20:03,350
without the uncles constantly getting in my way.

331
00:20:04,510 --> 00:20:06,640
So you'll be meeting people from Dreamweaver next?

332
00:20:06,750 --> 00:20:07,590
Hopefully.

333
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:10,750
At least I should be able to find out how they contact Eastern Hall

334
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:12,750
and get a lead I can follow.

335
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:15,240
I know this hasn't been easy.

336
00:20:18,030 --> 00:20:21,030
I thought I'd only be in Eastern Hall for a few months.

337
00:20:21,510 --> 00:20:22,960
I never expected it to take this long.

338
00:20:23,510 --> 00:20:24,350
Hang in there a little longer.

339
00:20:25,350 --> 00:20:26,550
Things are going smoothly now.

340
00:20:26,550 --> 00:20:27,400
We should be able to wrap up soon.

341
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:29,110
I hope so.

342
00:20:30,830 --> 00:20:32,640
I told you long ago this wouldn't be easy.

343
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,310
I really don't understand.

344
00:20:34,510 --> 00:20:36,440
You knew how difficult and dangerous it would be.

345
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:37,350
Why did you still insist on doing this,

346
00:20:37,750 --> 00:20:38,720
you little traitor?

347
00:20:44,240 --> 00:20:45,590
I chose this path myself.

348
00:20:45,640 --> 00:20:46,920
No matter how hard it is, I'll see it through.

349
00:20:47,350 --> 00:20:48,270
However it turns out,

350
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:49,310
I won't regret my choice.

351
00:21:31,110 --> 00:21:32,550
Shooting is easy.

352
00:21:32,550 --> 00:21:35,110
"Your left hand is only there to guide the ball." Ever heard that before?

353
00:21:36,160 --> 00:21:37,590
Shoot it like this.

354
00:21:38,830 --> 00:21:40,590
Hold the ball properly.

355
00:21:43,790 --> 00:21:44,750
Grip it from above.

356
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:47,000
Push with your middle finger.

357
00:21:48,720 --> 00:21:49,270
Raise it up

358
00:21:51,310 --> 00:21:52,240
and release from here.

359
00:22:50,030 --> 00:22:50,750
Chloe,

360
00:22:51,350 --> 00:22:52,920
is Vincent coming or not?

361
00:22:54,310 --> 00:22:55,590
He should be here soon.

362
00:22:55,960 --> 00:22:56,720
Should?

363
00:22:57,550 --> 00:22:58,590
You don't know?

364
00:22:59,550 --> 00:23:01,310
Didn't you speak to him this morning?

365
00:23:02,550 --> 00:23:04,440
I'll have Natalie call him.

366
00:23:08,350 --> 00:23:10,000
Looks like he isn't coming.

367
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:14,000
Every time we have a meeting, he's either absent or late.

368
00:23:14,440 --> 00:23:16,790
Does he even want to remain chairman?

369
00:23:17,510 --> 00:23:19,350
I think Vincent just isn't feeling well.

370
00:23:19,510 --> 00:23:20,310
Not feeling well?

371
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:22,790
He's been unwell for quite a few days now.

372
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:24,680
Chloe,

373
00:23:24,790 --> 00:23:26,960
you really need to take better care of Vincent.

374
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,550
Looks like he isn't coming after all.

375
00:23:35,550 --> 00:23:37,590
We have a quorum anyway.

376
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:39,030
Let's get started while we wait.

377
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:41,590
First item on the agenda:

378
00:23:42,640 --> 00:23:46,920
the expansion plan for the Bayfront Metropolis project.

379
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:53,720
Chloe?

380
00:24:08,510 --> 00:24:11,000
You've been disappearing from work every day just to drink here?

381
00:24:12,030 --> 00:24:12,960
No.

382
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:14,550
I've got plenty to deal with.

383
00:24:15,200 --> 00:24:16,000
Smoking.

384
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:17,550
Sleeping.

385
00:24:18,920 --> 00:24:19,750
Hui Loek To,

386
00:24:19,880 --> 00:24:21,590
you were the one who asked me to work with you.

387
00:24:21,720 --> 00:24:23,750
You haven't lifted a finger for our wedding.

388
00:24:23,750 --> 00:24:24,960
Fine. I can live with that.

389
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:27,790
I'll treat the wedding like a show and plan it myself.

390
00:24:27,830 --> 00:24:28,960
I'll pick out the clothes I like

391
00:24:28,960 --> 00:24:30,920
and arrange the venue myself. That's all fine.

392
00:24:31,510 --> 00:24:33,000
But now you won't even go back to the office.

393
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:34,160
What exactly do you want?

394
00:24:34,310 --> 00:24:36,350
Do you still care about the Bayfront Metropolis project?

395
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:38,110
What if I do?

396
00:24:38,110 --> 00:24:38,920
What if I don't?

397
00:24:39,790 --> 00:24:41,110
Everything's been decided.

398
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:44,400
I'm telling you,

399
00:24:44,720 --> 00:24:46,720
don't think the So family won't pull out.

400
00:24:46,960 --> 00:24:48,550
My patience has limits.

401
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,110
You'd better get yourself together.

402
00:24:51,510 --> 00:24:52,590
Go on.

403
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:54,160
Everyone might as well leave.

404
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:00,720
Are you here to lecture me too?

405
00:25:01,110 --> 00:25:02,270
Chloe already said

406
00:25:02,680 --> 00:25:03,920
everything that needed saying.

407
00:25:04,110 --> 00:25:04,640
I'm here

408
00:25:04,680 --> 00:25:05,830
to drink with you.

409
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:13,750
You okay?

410
00:25:14,920 --> 00:25:17,160
If you can't drink, don't force it just to look cool.

411
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:19,830
I really don't get why you all love drinking so much.

412
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:22,350
You don't drink much, so of course you wouldn't understand.

413
00:25:22,790 --> 00:25:24,310
Right. I don't know anything.

414
00:25:24,440 --> 00:25:27,110
I don't know how much you really love that man.

415
00:25:27,110 --> 00:25:30,350
I don't know why you're turning yourself into such a wreck over him

416
00:25:30,350 --> 00:25:32,110
or how much longer you're going to stay miserable.

417
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,440
But

418
00:25:38,510 --> 00:25:40,590
I'm not going to tell you to move on,

419
00:25:40,590 --> 00:25:42,590
give up, or any of that nonsense.

420
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:45,790
I'm your brother. Whatever happens, I've got your back.

421
00:25:47,350 --> 00:25:49,110
All those years I doted on you weren't wasted.

422
00:25:49,920 --> 00:25:51,400
Finally, something sensible.

423
00:25:52,350 --> 00:25:52,880
Come on.

424
00:25:52,880 --> 00:25:53,750
Have a few more drinks with me.

425
00:25:58,640 --> 00:26:00,350
I've had enough.

426
00:26:01,110 --> 00:26:03,110
One drunk brother is enough.

427
00:26:03,720 --> 00:26:04,830
I'll help take care of things

428
00:26:04,830 --> 00:26:06,310
at the company.

429
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:07,720
Don't worry.

430
00:26:07,960 --> 00:26:08,960
But you

431
00:26:08,960 --> 00:26:11,350
should take your time and figure out what you really want to do.

432
00:26:21,030 --> 00:26:22,960
I've looked everywhere I can.

433
00:26:24,110 --> 00:26:26,000
I've contacted everyone I can.

434
00:26:27,270 --> 00:26:28,550
There's still no word from him.

435
00:26:30,480 --> 00:26:31,920
What else can I do?

436
00:26:34,590 --> 00:26:35,400
I don't know.

437
00:26:36,270 --> 00:26:38,160
But maybe try imagining this.

438
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:40,310
If you ever get to see the person you love again,

439
00:26:40,510 --> 00:26:43,160
do you want him to see you as a complete wreck,

440
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:44,550
reeking of alcohol,

441
00:26:44,830 --> 00:26:47,920
or as the handsome, confident Hui Loek To who can do anything?

442
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:55,030
By the way,

443
00:26:55,960 --> 00:26:56,550
Loek To,

444
00:26:56,830 --> 00:26:59,030
take a shower. You smell awful.

445
00:27:00,790 --> 00:27:01,590
I'm off.

446
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:15,350
Am I embarrassing you now?

447
00:27:17,110 --> 00:27:18,030
Yes.

448
00:27:20,270 --> 00:27:21,960
Next time, use your head before you

449
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:23,400
come asking me questions.

450
00:27:32,220 --> 00:27:37,380
♪Loving you always comes with rumours and whispers♪

451
00:27:38,930 --> 00:27:40,560
♪I hear♪

452
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:42,240
You came to me on your own.

453
00:27:42,370 --> 00:27:44,370
♪You treat love like a circus act♪

454
00:27:44,950 --> 00:27:47,440
♪You make me happy, then forget it all♪

455
00:27:48,260 --> 00:27:50,850
♪You admire me, then cast me aside♪

456
00:27:52,090 --> 00:27:54,840
♪Loving you means...♪

457
00:27:54,920 --> 00:27:56,240
So you'll sleep with anyone.

458
00:27:56,640 --> 00:27:58,270
You said I came to you on my own.

459
00:27:59,440 --> 00:28:01,200
Then today, you came and sprayed me with water.

460
00:28:01,350 --> 00:28:02,830
Are you saying you want to end things?

461
00:28:03,000 --> 00:28:03,590
That's right.

462
00:28:03,880 --> 00:28:04,720
You said it.

463
00:28:06,030 --> 00:28:09,410
♪How thrilling can it really be?♪

464
00:28:09,960 --> 00:28:13,000
Who is Ms. So going to marry?

465
00:28:13,400 --> 00:28:14,590
Me, of course.

466
00:28:14,590 --> 00:28:15,590
Who else could it be?

467
00:28:16,200 --> 00:28:18,680
The marriage is fake.

468
00:28:19,000 --> 00:28:20,640
You're being unreasonable!

469
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:21,920
It's fake.

470
00:28:21,920 --> 00:28:23,000
I said it's fake!

471
00:28:23,680 --> 00:28:24,680
When I socialise with people,

472
00:28:25,110 --> 00:28:26,270
I have to bring a female companion.

473
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:28,240
A man can only be kept at home.

474
00:28:29,230 --> 00:28:30,750
♪Walk away♪

475
00:28:57,270 --> 00:28:58,240
Oh, you're finally awake?

476
00:28:59,310 --> 00:28:59,880
Perfect.

477
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:00,960
Chloe asked me to bring this over.

478
00:29:01,880 --> 00:29:04,030
Want to try on the wedding tuxedo first?

479
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:06,070
I can try that anytime.

480
00:29:06,070 --> 00:29:07,400
Let's deal with work first.

481
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:09,400
What's on the schedule today?

482
00:29:09,790 --> 00:29:11,400
Nothing much today or tomorrow.

483
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:13,640
You can go back to the office and hear briefings from the different departments

484
00:29:13,640 --> 00:29:15,440
on the progress of Bayfront Metropolis.

485
00:29:15,920 --> 00:29:18,240
There's a government interdepartmental consultation the day after tomorrow.

486
00:29:18,720 --> 00:29:20,510
I think you should make an appearance.

487
00:29:20,640 --> 00:29:21,440
All right.

488
00:29:21,790 --> 00:29:23,400
The day after that is a little different.

489
00:29:24,240 --> 00:29:27,240
Ms. Ho from Eastern Hall invited you to a gathering at their headquarters.

490
00:29:27,310 --> 00:29:29,720
Apparently, the biggest gangs in Hong Kong, China will all be there.

491
00:29:31,310 --> 00:29:32,110
Eastern Hall?

492
00:29:33,000 --> 00:29:35,310
We've never really had dealings with them.

493
00:29:36,000 --> 00:29:37,310
Why invite us out of the blue?

494
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:41,790
They've spent the past year tearing each other apart over who gets to lead.

495
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:45,000
Word is, the second daughter, Ho Tung Fong, came out on top.

496
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:47,400
I think everyone's going to see what she's up to.

497
00:29:48,590 --> 00:29:49,400
Right.

498
00:29:50,440 --> 00:29:51,240
Let's go.

499
00:30:06,070 --> 00:30:06,880
Vincent?

500
00:30:10,240 --> 00:30:12,070
Long time no see.

501
00:30:12,310 --> 00:30:13,110
Uncle Kau.

502
00:30:14,680 --> 00:30:15,920
Now that's not right.

503
00:30:17,000 --> 00:30:19,030
Every time I ask you out for tea, you're always busy.

504
00:30:19,880 --> 00:30:21,510
So what brings you out today?

505
00:30:22,590 --> 00:30:24,720
Eastern Hall's new leader invited us.

506
00:30:25,310 --> 00:30:26,960
I had to show some respect

507
00:30:26,960 --> 00:30:27,880
and come see what's going on.

508
00:30:29,510 --> 00:30:30,400
What's all this about?

509
00:30:31,590 --> 00:30:33,400
Why bring so many people

510
00:30:33,680 --> 00:30:35,510
and make such a big show of it?

511
00:30:35,830 --> 00:30:37,400
The new leader

512
00:30:38,400 --> 00:30:39,440
wants to show who's boss

513
00:30:39,590 --> 00:30:41,400
and size everyone up. That's normal.

514
00:30:41,920 --> 00:30:42,720
Hmm.

515
00:30:45,270 --> 00:30:46,640
Gentlemen,

516
00:30:46,640 --> 00:30:47,200
this way.

517
00:31:24,790 --> 00:31:27,200
Thank you all for coming to Eastern Hall.

518
00:31:28,790 --> 00:31:29,640
Over the past year,

519
00:31:30,440 --> 00:31:34,070
I'm sure you've all heard about some internal disputes within Eastern Hall.

520
00:31:34,790 --> 00:31:37,440
I invited everyone today to tell you

521
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:39,480
that all those problems have been resolved.

522
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:41,000
And I

523
00:31:41,270 --> 00:31:43,550
will be leading Eastern Hall from now on.

524
00:31:44,110 --> 00:31:45,440
I hope that going forward,

525
00:31:45,440 --> 00:31:46,640
we'll stick to the old rules.

526
00:31:47,240 --> 00:31:49,310
Let's all make money together, keep things friendly,

527
00:31:49,790 --> 00:31:51,640
and stay out of each other's way.

528
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:55,070
Gentlemen,

529
00:31:56,000 --> 00:31:57,110
what do you say?

530
00:32:00,110 --> 00:32:00,920
Sounds good.

531
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:03,830
Business should be about making money

532
00:32:04,640 --> 00:32:05,880
and keeping the peace.

533
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:20,680
Mr. Hui,

534
00:32:21,480 --> 00:32:24,400
does Sheng Tung have any objections?

535
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:26,680
Ms. Ho,

536
00:32:28,640 --> 00:32:31,680
I haven't seen this man before.

537
00:32:33,640 --> 00:32:35,200
Let me introduce him while we're at it.

538
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:37,880
This is my fiancé, Foon.

539
00:32:38,680 --> 00:32:40,400
We're getting married soon.

540
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:45,400
Wonderful.

541
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:48,030
You've become the new leader, and you're getting married.

542
00:32:48,030 --> 00:32:49,270
Two reasons to celebrate.

543
00:32:49,880 --> 00:32:50,510
Ms. Ho,

544
00:32:50,510 --> 00:32:51,920
congratulations. Let's have a drink.

545
00:32:52,510 --> 00:32:53,110
Thank you.

546
00:33:06,270 --> 00:33:07,640
I'll keep an eye on things here.

547
00:33:07,830 --> 00:33:09,110
You go back to the workshop.

548
00:33:09,640 --> 00:33:10,640
Understood, Foon Gor.

549
00:33:16,790 --> 00:33:17,640
Hello,

550
00:33:18,680 --> 00:33:20,480
Eastern Hall's leader's fiancé.

551
00:33:21,110 --> 00:33:21,920
Get lost.

552
00:33:24,440 --> 00:33:26,440
How did you get involved with Ho Tung Fong?

553
00:33:27,000 --> 00:33:28,400
What's it to you?

554
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:32,270
Mr. Hui,

555
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:34,200
please mind your manners.

556
00:33:35,590 --> 00:33:37,270
You've been hiding out at Eastern Hall all this time?

557
00:33:40,070 --> 00:33:41,920
Do you know how long I've been looking for you?

558
00:33:46,000 --> 00:33:47,720
Did you get engaged to Ho Tung Fong

559
00:33:48,440 --> 00:33:49,640
just to get a rise out of me?

560
00:33:49,830 --> 00:33:51,480
Not everything is about you.

561
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:53,440
Are you undercover again?

562
00:33:55,480 --> 00:33:56,880
Watch what you say.

563
00:34:00,030 --> 00:34:02,000
If you're wanted by the police,

564
00:34:02,000 --> 00:34:03,480
you don't have to stay with Eastern Hall.

565
00:34:04,000 --> 00:34:05,240
Come back to me.

566
00:34:05,440 --> 00:34:06,750
I can take care of you too.

567
00:34:10,110 --> 00:34:11,510
Don't go.

568
00:34:11,510 --> 00:34:13,190
We can talk about everything else later, okay?

569
00:34:13,280 --> 00:34:14,320
Don't touch me.

570
00:34:14,630 --> 00:34:16,110
I have nothing to say to you.

571
00:34:16,510 --> 00:34:17,840
Please stay away from me.

572
00:34:19,030 --> 00:34:19,840
Mr. Hui,

573
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:23,070
what do you want with my fiancé?

574
00:34:23,840 --> 00:34:24,880
Boss, is everything all right?

575
00:34:26,190 --> 00:34:27,000
I'm fine.

576
00:34:29,880 --> 00:34:30,710
You know him?

577
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:34,070
When I was a cop, I raided his place.

578
00:34:37,670 --> 00:34:40,630
So Eastern Hall even takes in renegade cops now.

579
00:34:41,190 --> 00:34:42,840
You're more generous than a charity.

580
00:34:43,070 --> 00:34:44,590
Are you telling me how to run things?

581
00:34:46,190 --> 00:34:48,110
I don't care about Eastern Hall.

582
00:34:49,000 --> 00:34:51,110
I just want this cop dead.

583
00:34:52,440 --> 00:34:53,230
Are you out of your mind?

584
00:34:54,880 --> 00:34:56,590
You raided my place before

585
00:34:56,590 --> 00:34:58,190
and even took me back to the station.

586
00:34:58,840 --> 00:35:00,630
You think I'd just let that go?

587
00:35:02,480 --> 00:35:03,280
Ms. Ho,

588
00:35:04,320 --> 00:35:05,440
name your price.

589
00:35:05,710 --> 00:35:07,440
How much will it take for you to hand him over?

590
00:35:08,230 --> 00:35:09,030
Are you serious?

591
00:35:09,510 --> 00:35:10,320
Completely.

592
00:35:11,030 --> 00:35:14,070
Consider it a gift to celebrate your rise to power.

593
00:35:16,190 --> 00:35:17,070
Sorry.

594
00:35:17,400 --> 00:35:19,070
My fiancé isn't for sale.

595
00:35:19,630 --> 00:35:21,000
You know he's a cop,

596
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:22,670
and you're still keeping him around?

597
00:35:22,840 --> 00:35:24,440
How I run Eastern Hall

598
00:35:25,030 --> 00:35:26,840
and who I keep around me are none of your business.

599
00:35:27,630 --> 00:35:29,400
Please take your people and leave.

600
00:35:29,840 --> 00:35:31,030
We won't see you out.

601
00:35:38,800 --> 00:35:39,920
This isn't over.

602
00:35:44,110 --> 00:35:46,630
Don't let me see anyone from Sheng Tung at Eastern Hall again.

603
00:35:47,190 --> 00:35:48,190
Understood.

604
00:36:08,030 --> 00:36:08,840
Foon.

605
00:36:23,590 --> 00:36:26,630
What exactly happened between you and Hui Loek To?

606
00:36:27,440 --> 00:36:29,480
I was on the team that raided his place.

607
00:36:30,280 --> 00:36:32,440
And I took him back to the station and questioned him.

608
00:36:33,190 --> 00:36:35,150
It was all standard police procedure.

609
00:36:35,320 --> 00:36:36,440
Nothing special.

610
00:36:36,630 --> 00:36:37,440
Anything else?

611
00:36:37,630 --> 00:36:39,030
In the end, the police didn't charge him.

612
00:36:39,840 --> 00:36:41,190
I never saw him again.

613
00:36:41,880 --> 00:36:44,440
So Hui Loek To got questioned once,

614
00:36:45,030 --> 00:36:46,440
and now he wants to take revenge on you?

615
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:49,000
Who knows?

616
00:36:49,920 --> 00:36:52,320
Rich people can be so petty.

617
00:36:55,440 --> 00:36:56,880
Try to stay away from him from now on.

618
00:36:58,110 --> 00:37:00,840
Eastern Hall and Sheng Tung have never got along.

619
00:37:01,630 --> 00:37:04,070
If the uncles see you getting involved with him,

620
00:37:04,590 --> 00:37:05,630
they'll definitely have something to say.

621
00:37:06,840 --> 00:37:07,480
Got it.

622
00:37:07,630 --> 00:37:08,800
I'll be careful.

623
00:37:09,440 --> 00:37:10,840
I won't cause you any more trouble.

624
00:37:12,190 --> 00:37:14,840
I used our engagement to silence the uncles

625
00:37:15,510 --> 00:37:17,190
because I trusted that you were capable

626
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:19,630
of dealing with the police

627
00:37:19,670 --> 00:37:20,840
and staying ahead of their investigations,

628
00:37:21,590 --> 00:37:23,480
helping Eastern Hall to grow.

629
00:37:23,920 --> 00:37:26,190
There are still many businesses you haven't been involved in.

630
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:28,440
I don't want any more complications.

631
00:37:29,840 --> 00:37:32,190
Doesn't Eastern Hall only deal in arms?

632
00:37:32,920 --> 00:37:34,400
Don't the police have a file on us?

633
00:37:34,880 --> 00:37:35,550
They do.

634
00:37:35,920 --> 00:37:37,030
But I've never read it.

635
00:37:38,670 --> 00:37:41,320
We've been dealing in counterfeit money these past few years.

636
00:37:42,110 --> 00:37:44,590
At first, we only helped others distribute it.

637
00:37:45,880 --> 00:37:48,510
But eventually, we realised Eastern Hall could produce it too.

638
00:37:49,110 --> 00:37:50,190
Others?

639
00:37:51,000 --> 00:37:52,280
You'll find out soon enough.

640
00:37:55,000 --> 00:37:55,800
So,

641
00:37:56,880 --> 00:37:58,510
you're really not hiding anything from me?

642
00:37:59,670 --> 00:38:01,710
I've told you everything I have to say.

643
00:38:02,480 --> 00:38:05,400
You can keep testing me like when you suspected me

644
00:38:06,000 --> 00:38:07,400
after I left the police force,

645
00:38:07,710 --> 00:38:10,110
but I'll prove to you again and again

646
00:38:10,320 --> 00:38:11,710
that I've never lied to you.

647
00:38:16,510 --> 00:38:17,440
Get some rest.

648
00:38:43,030 --> 00:38:44,480
Whatever you're thinking right now,

649
00:38:45,000 --> 00:38:46,230
the answer is no.

650
00:38:48,070 --> 00:38:50,840
You mean we should just leave him at Eastern Hall?

651
00:38:50,920 --> 00:38:53,840
You heard Ho Tung Fong just now. She's clearly protecting Mr. Mok.

652
00:38:54,630 --> 00:38:55,840
He'll be fine.

653
00:38:56,110 --> 00:38:57,590
That woman, Ho Tung Fong,

654
00:38:58,230 --> 00:38:59,280
killed her own father

655
00:38:59,840 --> 00:39:01,630
and uncle just to take power.

656
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:04,480
The longer Mok Fei Foon stays by her side,

657
00:39:04,710 --> 00:39:06,280
the more danger he'll be in.

658
00:39:06,590 --> 00:39:08,480
You don't know why Mr. Mok went to the Ho family.

659
00:39:09,110 --> 00:39:10,440
If you act rashly,

660
00:39:10,440 --> 00:39:12,000
there's no telling what could happen.

661
00:39:12,630 --> 00:39:13,440
That's true.

662
00:39:14,480 --> 00:39:16,320
But Ho Tung Fong is dangerous.

663
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:17,440
That's a fact.

664
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:23,110
We've been at odds with Eastern Hall for years.

665
00:39:23,230 --> 00:39:24,440
Things are already tense between us.

666
00:39:25,070 --> 00:39:26,630
If you keep interfering,

667
00:39:28,510 --> 00:39:30,070
Eastern Hall may start suspecting Mr. Mok,

668
00:39:30,590 --> 00:39:32,230
and it could cost him his life.

669
00:39:34,630 --> 00:39:35,920
He can't stay at Eastern Hall.

670
00:39:36,800 --> 00:39:38,280
Do you want him safe,

671
00:39:38,920 --> 00:39:40,280
or do you just want to keep him by your side?

672
00:39:41,000 --> 00:39:42,000
Don't forget.

673
00:39:43,190 --> 00:39:44,800
He's Ho Tung Fong's fiancé now.

674
00:39:44,880 --> 00:39:46,190
So what if they're engaged?

675
00:39:50,230 --> 00:39:51,400
Then what are you planning to do?

676
00:40:03,800 --> 00:40:05,030
Go to Eastern Hall

677
00:40:05,440 --> 00:40:06,760
and take him away.

678
00:40:10,810 --> 00:40:21,470
[Episode 6]

679
00:40:21,560 --> 00:40:31,960
[This story is fictional. Any resemblance is entirely coincidental.]
